            "detailed_description": "At the end of the 21st Century, robots finally enslaved mankind. Desperately, a few pockets of the human resistance fight on. You are Gunlok, a member of Earth’s Special Forces. Isolated during the robots’ uprising, you’ve now mastered your experimental battle armour and decided to return from the wilderness.<br><br>Now, it’s time for revenge. Time to strike back, and bring warfare to the robots.<br><br>• Team based gameplay allows you to control up to 5 characters.<br>• Features 15 massive singleplayer levels, and a multiplayer mode (LAN only)<br>• Personalised, customisable characters with upgradeable weapons.<br><br><i>*Multiplayer notice: Because official multiplayer servers have been taken offline, playing over the Internet is no longer supported. Playing through a LAN is still available.</i>",
